{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:30b0d51999ca7ab8","name":"Veteran Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-30b0d51999ca7ab8","title":"Veteran Talent Tree","revision":20988,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:56:44Z","sha256":"894b62a815ff83644b9160289761744187a54ae4969e4275495fe702a76980ba","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20988","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Veteran%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-30b0d51999ca7ab8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have been from one side of the galaxy to the other and have fought on more planets than most people visit in a lifetime. Talents from this tree can be used to qualify for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officer","referenceId":"reference:192135a8adabe174"}," Prestige Class, in addition to those listed in the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Battlefield Remedy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have learned a variety of different ways to treat combat injuries in the field. When you succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"}," check to administer ",{"tag":"a","children":["First Aid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/First_Aid"},", the tended creature also moves +1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Grizzled Warrior"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Seen It All"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Tested in Battle"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can draw upon your extensive battlefield experience to encourage your comrades and drive your enemies before you. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Defy the Odds:"]}," Make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},". You immediately gain a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Double the Pain:"]}," When you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action to provide an ally within 6 squares of you a bonus to his or her attack roll, add one-half your Character Level to the ally's damage roll if the attack is successful."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Guarded Assault:"]}," Make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},". You gain a +2 dodge bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against all attacks until the start of your next turn."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Reckless"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Tested in Battle"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know from first-hand experience that victory goes to those willing to take a chance. You can add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," bonus (minimum +1) to the damage roll when you make a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"}," attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Seen It All"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Tested in Battle"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have seen more action in more places than most people know exist, and little in the galaxy gets you rattled. Any character using a Fear effect on you must roll twice, keeping the lower result on any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," and attack rolls.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Tested in Battle"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you catch a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"},", you move +2 steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," in addition to regaining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
